// The app icon (assets/sovereign.ico, built by tools/icon/make_ico.ps1):
// Explorer shows it for the exe; icons.cpp puts the state dot on it for the
// tray. The flags sprite: the window draws the exit IP's country with it.
// The night: the main screen's backdrop (generated with Qwen for this app,
// monochrome: a night valley, a path of light from the foot of the picture
// to a glow on the horizon - from the switch, which stands at the foot).
// SVC_<ID>: a service's logo (assets/services, icons.h ServiceLogo).
#include "resource.h"

IDI_SOVEREIGN ICON "../../assets/sovereign.ico"
IDR_FLAGS RCDATA "../../assets/flags/flags.png"
IDR_NIGHT RCDATA "../../assets/backdrop/night.jpg"

